    <title>RAG World: chronicle of changes</title>
    <description>Maturity level changes for RAG technologies</description>
    <language>en</language>
    <link>https://ragworld.org/changes</link>
    <lastBuildDate>2026-08-13</lastBuildDate>
    <item>
      <title>Digest for 2026-08-12</title>
      <description>Received a level for the first time: 11 records, namely Auto-RAG, DSPy, GNN-RAG, GraphReader, KAG, Poison-RAG, RA-ISF, REPLUG and 3 more. Rose in level: ColPali from L1 to L2, RAG as Memory from L1 to L2, Speculative RAG from L1 to L2. Collected 54 pieces of evidence: 36 about publications, 13 about package downloads, 5 about repositories. The registry now holds 62 records. Level L0 in 7 records, L1 in 18, L2 in 29, L3 in 3, L4 in 1, L5 in 1. For 3 records no level is computed, because there is no evidence yet.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">digest-2026-08-12</guid>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Digest for 2026-08-10</title>
      <description>Rose in level: HippoRAG from L0 to L4, Dense X from L1 to L2, Edge and On-Device RAG from L0 to L1. Collected 45 pieces of evidence: 35 about publications, 7 about package downloads, 3 about repositories. The registry now holds 53 records. Level L0 in 7 records, L1 in 17, L2 in 19, L3 in 3, L4 in 1, L5 in 1. For 5 records no level is computed, because there is no evidence yet.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">digest-2026-08-10</guid>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Digest for 2026-08-09</title>
      <description>Received a level for the first time: 48 records, namely Adaptive RAG, ArchRAG, CRAG, CausalRAG, ChatQA, ColBERT, ColPali, Dense X and 40 more. Rose in level: Adaptive RAG from L1 to L2, ArchRAG from L1 to L2, CausalRAG from L0 to L3, ChatQA from L1 to L2, Federated RAG from L0 to L3, FLARE from L1 to L2, HyDE from L1 to L2, IRCoT from L1 to L2, plus 11 records. Collected 92 pieces of evidence: 65 about publications, 11 about repositories, 7 about package downloads, 5 about presence in frameworks, 4 about industrial use. The registry now holds 54 records. Level L0 in 9 records, L1 in 17, L2 in 18, L3 in 3, L5 in 1. For 6 records no level is computed, because there is no evidence yet.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">digest-2026-08-09</guid>
    </item>
